### Fase 5: Algoritma Genetika V2 (Re-write Total) ⚠️ CORE

**Ini adalah jantung perubahan.** AG V1 hanya mengatur `[student, room, desk]`. AG V2 mengatur `[student, level, subject, day, time_session, room, desk]`.

---

#### [MODIFY] [GeneticAlgorithmService.php](file:///c:/laragon/www/kartu-ujian-app/app/Services/GeneticAlgorithmService.php)

**Rewrite total.** Perubahan utama:

| Aspek | V1 (Saat Ini) | V2 (Target) |
|-------|---------------|-------------|
| **Gen** | `{student_id, room_id, desk}` | `{student_id, level_id, subject_id, day_index, time_session_id, room_id, desk}` |
| **Populasi Init** | Acak room + desk | Acak day + session + room + desk, dengan distribusi proporsional per level |
| **Fitness** | Cek overcapacity + desk collision saja | + Level mixing, student collision (bentrok waktu), subject scattering, room underutilization |
| **Crossover** | Single-point | **Uniform crossover** (50/50 per gen) |
| **Mutasi** | Acak buta (room + desk) | **Targeted mutation** (ubah waktu jika bentrok waktu, ubah ruang jika overcapacity) |
| **Hard Constraints** | 2 jenis (+100) | 4 jenis (+100): Overcapacity, Level Mixing, Student Collision, Desk Collision |
| **Soft Constraints** | Tidak ada | 2 jenis: Subject Scattering (+10), Room Underutilization (+5) |
| **Proporsi Ruangan** | Tidak ada | Ruangan dialokasikan utuh per level, bukan dicampur |

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Parameter AG yang dioptimalkan (keputusan user):**
> ```php
> protected $populationSize = 25;    // Turun dari 100 → 25 (cukup karena targeted mutation)
> protected $maxGenerations = 100;   // Turun dari 1000 → 100 (Skill Agent mempercepat konvergensi)
> protected $mutationRate = 0.10;    // Tetap 10%
> ```
> Alasan: Dengan Skill Agent (targeted mutation + repair function + heuristik inisialisasi), pencarian solusi jauh lebih efisien sehingga tidak perlu populasi/generasi besar.

**Fungsi baru yang harus dibuat:**
1. `initializePopulation()` — Multi-dimensi, distribusi mapel proporsional + heuristik round-robin
2. `evaluateFitness()` — 4 hard + 2 soft constraints (lihat detail di Skill Agent)
3. `uniformCrossover()` — Ganti single-point
4. `targetedMutate()` — Mutasi cerdas berdasarkan jenis pelanggaran
5. `repair()` — Perbaiki desk collision dan overcapacity sederhana pasca-crossover
6. `translateToDatabase()` — Konversi gen terbaik → `exam_schedules` + `exam_allocations`

